          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/e13760ad536f15a3280ae555c65ff922cf820478"
        }
      ],
      "message": "p2p: move ping timeout check into SendMessages\n\nThe check is relocated from MaybeSendPing to the timeout\nsection of SendMessages, right after the block download timeout.\n\nThis is in preparation for the following commit, which makes the ping timeout depend\non whether the peer is currently serving us blocks.\nThat requires CNodeState, which is guarded by cs_main and therefore not reachable from MaybeSendPing.\n\nMoving it makes sense anyway, since timout decisions don't really\nbelong in a function called MaybeSendPing.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Martin Zumsande",
        "email": "mzumsande@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-08-25T14:33:40Z"
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "Martin Zumsande",
        "email": "mzumsande@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-08-24T16:47:02Z"
      },
